WEBVTT

00:00:19.940 --> 00:00:20.580
Damn it!

00:00:23.900 --> 00:00:25.530
Wait up, yo!

00:00:25.530 --> 00:00:28.420
Say that all you want. There's no
one who'd wait for you, you idiot!

00:00:28.420 --> 00:00:30.180
Shut up, you geezer!

00:00:38.550 --> 00:00:41.900
Blue. The color of danger.

00:00:49.920 --> 00:00:51.060
It's...

00:00:52.300 --> 00:00:54.830
the color of your soul

00:00:55.640 --> 00:00:57.330
as you try not to sink.

00:01:01.790 --> 00:01:02.600
Sky blue.

00:01:03.880 --> 00:01:07.080
The color of the vast sky.

00:01:09.150 --> 00:01:11.430
What we now see as colorless

00:01:12.400 --> 00:01:15.300
could be seen with color as before.

00:01:41.900 --> 00:01:46.230
I am lost in my thought as the days pass me by

00:01:41.900 --> 00:01:46.230
Meutsuri Shiteru Hibi Are Kore

00:01:46.510 --> 00:01:50.370
No one has yet to realize my madness

00:01:51.060 --> 00:01:55.390
The crimson liquid trails down my goosey skin

00:01:51.060 --> 00:01:55.390
Awadatsu Hada wo Tsutai Ochiru CRIMSON

00:01:55.580 --> 00:01:59.580
Why do you wish for another punishment?

00:01:55.580 --> 00:01:59.580
Why do you want Atarashii Batsu wo

00:02:00.210 --> 00:02:04.330
These sweet scents floating with "blood"

00:02:00.210 --> 00:02:04.330
Tadayou Amai Kaori wo Tada

00:02:04.820 --> 00:02:08.890
Let the fragrances idle and drift about freely as I hoped they would

00:02:04.820 --> 00:02:08.890
Asobasete Itai Dake Nano sa

00:02:09.390 --> 00:02:16.570
Now please, hurry and pierce through me!

00:02:09.390 --> 00:02:16.570
Dareka Boku wo Hayaku Uchinuite yo

00:02:16.950 --> 00:02:21.720
Shoot me and put visible holes through my body

00:02:16.950 --> 00:02:21.720
Shoot me Kantsuushita Juusou Ana ga Aku Hodo

00:02:21.940 --> 00:02:26.190
Squeeze the thorny pistol grip,

00:02:21.940 --> 00:02:26.190
Toge Darake no GRIP Nigiritsubuse

00:02:26.550 --> 00:02:31.960
load the bullets that resemble red rosebuds,

00:02:26.550 --> 00:02:31.960
Osanai Mada Tsubomi no You na Dangan de

00:02:32.230 --> 00:02:36.070
and let me shoot through the flower!

00:02:32.230 --> 00:02:36.070
Let me shoot through the flower!

00:02:36.810 --> 00:02:40.510
Smear this world in rose!

00:02:36.810 --> 00:02:40.510
Bara-iro ni Somare

00:03:10.000 --> 00:03:10.940
Akira!

00:03:12.350 --> 00:03:17.570
I can't let you play this dangerous game by yourself!

00:03:19.060 --> 00:03:22.160
So... I'll participate in Igra too.

00:03:25.210 --> 00:03:26.630
Don't even try to stop me.

00:03:33.510 --> 00:03:35.050
Do whatever you want.

00:03:48.230 --> 00:03:49.180
Motomi!

00:03:49.630 --> 00:03:50.110
Yo!

00:03:50.640 --> 00:03:51.690
What a coincidence.

00:03:52.110 --> 00:03:53.820
I just happened to be passing by.

00:03:55.250 --> 00:03:57.130
That's a lot for someone who's just passing by.

00:03:57.130 --> 00:03:59.570
You're quite the heavy smoker, huh?

00:03:59.790 --> 00:04:01.360
Yeah whatever.

00:04:03.140 --> 00:04:05.030
Aren't you heading over to the Castle now?

00:04:05.420 --> 00:04:07.120
Do you mind if I tag along?

00:04:07.910 --> 00:04:10.180
You have some business with them, too?

00:04:10.180 --> 00:04:11.000
Yeah.

00:04:11.640 --> 00:04:16.220
Every now and then, I feel like paying a visit to that den of bad taste.

00:04:18.590 --> 00:04:21.010
Honestly, that sounds pretty reassuring.

00:04:21.330 --> 00:04:24.090
That makes me feel like it was worth coming here.

00:04:25.900 --> 00:04:26.870
Let's go.

00:04:28.900 --> 00:04:30.390
Hold on a sec!

00:04:34.360 --> 00:04:35.460
Ah, jeez.

00:04:54.220 --> 00:04:55.880
Well, shall we go in?

00:04:57.130 --> 00:04:57.810
Yes!

00:05:08.040 --> 00:05:08.810
Wear this.

00:05:18.200 --> 00:05:20.930
The decorations in this place are always so deranged.

00:05:20.930 --> 00:05:22.740
Meh, I guess that's just like him, though.

00:05:23.570 --> 00:05:24.450
Him?

00:05:24.820 --> 00:05:26.250
Mr. Arbitro.

00:05:26.900 --> 00:05:28.030
Arbitro...?

00:05:28.540 --> 00:05:30.750
You'll understand soon enough.

00:05:56.380 --> 00:05:58.070
I'll have you wait in this room.

00:06:01.470 --> 00:06:04.880
Why're you so nervous? Didn't you already make up your mind?

00:06:04.880 --> 00:06:05.830
Get a move on it.

00:06:10.230 --> 00:06:11.890
All right. I'll be right back.

00:06:20.950 --> 00:06:24.090
He should be showing up anytime now.

00:06:40.250 --> 00:06:41.640
My, my.

00:06:44.220 --> 00:06:44.740
Hey!

00:06:44.950 --> 00:06:47.580
Wh-What the--?!

00:06:47.790 --> 00:06:49.350
It's been a while, huh?

00:06:49.350 --> 00:06:50.960
Hey, you.

00:06:50.960 --> 00:06:52.290
Why are you here of all places?!

00:06:52.700 --> 00:06:55.020
Just a little field trip.

00:06:55.020 --> 00:07:00.530
I just wanted to see you all flustered, really.

00:07:00.530 --> 00:07:02.000
You have no business here!

00:07:04.090 --> 00:07:08.450
Man, your strange habits haven't changed, huh?

00:07:08.450 --> 00:07:11.430
After coming all the way over here, I've started to want one of these myself.

00:07:11.670 --> 00:07:12.630
Silence!

00:07:12.630 --> 00:07:14.610
You wouldn't even understand them!

00:07:14.610 --> 00:07:16.240
Get away from them!

00:07:16.240 --> 00:07:18.060
Ah, sorry!

00:07:18.970 --> 00:07:20.810
Don't you dare come here ever again!

00:07:20.810 --> 00:07:21.690
Got it?

00:07:23.680 --> 00:07:24.620
See ya later.

00:07:29.090 --> 00:07:30.680
So you two know each other?

00:07:30.680 --> 00:07:33.780
It's more like we can't get rid of each other.

00:07:33.780 --> 00:07:36.680
But you better keep your guard up.

00:07:36.680 --> 00:07:39.040
It seems like he's taken an interest in you.

00:07:39.720 --> 00:07:40.630
An interest in me?

00:07:40.630 --> 00:07:42.040
Oh yeah.

00:07:42.040 --> 00:07:44.840
If you met the Executioners, then you saw him too, right?

00:07:45.520 --> 00:07:46.720
The dog.

00:07:47.840 --> 00:07:48.720
The dog?

00:07:53.570 --> 00:07:57.340
That guy just loves young boys who have pretty faces.

00:07:57.850 --> 00:08:00.060
And he really loves tormenting them.

00:08:01.130 --> 00:08:02.510
What's beyond those doors?

00:08:03.660 --> 00:08:05.490
Beyond that would be the Colosseum.

00:08:05.830 --> 00:08:07.030
Colosseum?

00:08:07.450 --> 00:08:11.220
That's right. That's the arena where you fight Il Re.

00:08:11.910 --> 00:08:12.800
Il Re...

00:08:13.600 --> 00:08:16.830
It's the dueling platform for
declaring who the true drug lord is,

00:08:17.450 --> 00:08:20.880
but usually it's just closed like that.

00:08:21.570 --> 00:08:26.140
Actually, it hasn't been re-opened for quite a while now.

00:08:38.060 --> 00:08:40.170
Would you happen to be serious this time around?

00:08:40.170 --> 00:08:41.980
Or rather, are you ready to take this on?

00:08:42.430 --> 00:08:43.080
Yes.

00:08:44.970 --> 00:08:47.240
Then let me explain the rules for you.

00:08:48.220 --> 00:08:51.700
First of all, this so-called 'tag-game'
takes the form of a poker game.

00:08:53.190 --> 00:08:59.080
After you make a royal straight or a full house out of rank 10 and above tags,

00:08:59.600 --> 00:09:03.800
you will have the right to
challenge the King of Igra, Il Re.

00:09:04.130 --> 00:09:05.630
Challenge Il Re?

00:09:05.630 --> 00:09:09.150
Oh, right. I have yet to explain one matter.

00:09:10.520 --> 00:09:13.070
When fighting for a tag,

00:09:13.070 --> 00:09:15.970
you lose when your back hits the ground.

00:09:16.300 --> 00:09:19.230
At that point, the winner can take the loser's tag.

00:09:19.730 --> 00:09:20.980
It's pretty simple, right?

00:09:21.270 --> 00:09:21.990
Yes.

00:09:22.980 --> 00:09:25.490
I'll give you five tags to start with.

00:09:26.030 --> 00:09:29.310
You're required to wear one tag
visibly so that others can notice it

00:09:29.310 --> 00:09:33.110
as proof that you're currently participating in the game.

00:09:33.110 --> 00:09:35.360
If you happen to break one of these rules--

00:09:38.550 --> 00:09:39.670
What is the meaning of this?!

00:09:40.310 --> 00:09:41.780
Sup!

00:09:41.780 --> 00:09:43.500
We brought the corpse we took care of!

00:09:45.290 --> 00:09:46.630
You damned--!

00:09:46.630 --> 00:09:48.790
Don't bring such filth in here!

00:09:48.790 --> 00:09:51.430
And don't I always tell you to knock before entering?!

00:09:51.430 --> 00:09:53.830
You're such a pain in the ass.

00:09:54.850 --> 00:09:57.430
What's this? Another newbie, huh?

00:09:58.420 --> 00:10:04.650
You know, lately, there've been these idiots who don't fight but take tags from newbies.

00:10:05.010 --> 00:10:07.530
Can we kill all of 'em?

00:10:07.530 --> 00:10:09.030
If we were to condone such injustice,

00:10:09.030 --> 00:10:11.120
then all of Igra would become disheveled and disordered.

00:10:11.510 --> 00:10:13.240
Find all of those people and get rid of them!

00:10:14.820 --> 00:10:16.640
It's gonna be one hell of a blood festival!

00:10:16.640 --> 00:10:18.160
Let's go get 'em now!

00:10:18.160 --> 00:10:19.010
A'ight.

00:10:19.340 --> 00:10:22.250
W-Wait a moment! Take that with you!

00:10:23.880 --> 00:10:24.960
Huh? Fine.

00:10:25.230 --> 00:10:27.160
Hey, you. Go get it and carry it out.

00:10:27.160 --> 00:10:30.150
The fuck?! Why don't you?!  Didn't you 'okay' it just now?!

00:10:30.150 --> 00:10:32.160
I've got heavy ol' Mitsuko to deal with.

00:10:32.160 --> 00:10:34.040
As if that metal pipe would be heavy for you!

00:10:34.040 --> 00:10:35.610
'Ey, wait, hey yo!

00:10:37.820 --> 00:10:39.240
I apologize.

00:10:39.240 --> 00:10:40.560
N-Not at all...

00:10:40.770 --> 00:10:44.400
Now would be a good time to tell you about those guys.

00:10:44.930 --> 00:10:47.720
They're observers who look for rule breakers.

00:10:48.260 --> 00:10:49.360
Observers?

00:10:50.040 --> 00:10:51.770
Their job is to go around Toshima,

00:10:51.770 --> 00:10:57.070
find those who break Igra's rules, and punish them.

00:10:57.540 --> 00:10:58.310
Break?

00:10:58.830 --> 00:11:01.090
In Igra, you're not allowed to

00:11:01.090 --> 00:11:02.690
have possession of some sort of firearm,

00:11:02.690 --> 00:11:04.820
have a battle without any other eye-witnesses,

00:11:04.820 --> 00:11:07.310
or use any cowardly surprise attacks.

00:11:07.310 --> 00:11:10.330
And like I mentioned before, not
showing any tags is also against the rules.

00:11:10.330 --> 00:11:13.160
So is giving up in Igra altogether.

00:11:14.510 --> 00:11:16.550
What happens to those who break those rules?

00:11:16.840 --> 00:11:19.390
Didn't you see that corpse earlier?

00:11:23.040 --> 00:11:26.060
Pray you don't end up like him.

00:11:36.750 --> 00:11:37.660
Sorry for the wait.

00:11:38.050 --> 00:11:39.480
I've got myself some tags now.

00:11:43.410 --> 00:11:47.120
Now you won't be able to back out of this.

00:11:47.120 --> 00:11:47.740
Right.

00:11:49.640 --> 00:11:51.630
Don't you have something to say?

00:11:53.070 --> 00:11:54.060
Not really.

00:11:57.950 --> 00:11:59.320
You look like shit.

00:12:01.290 --> 00:12:02.980
I-Is that so?

00:12:19.980 --> 00:12:21.620
That damned Motomi!

00:12:22.140 --> 00:12:25.450
Damn it! Damn it, damn it, DAMN IT!

00:12:35.670 --> 00:12:36.720
I'm so sorry.

00:12:37.130 --> 00:12:38.320
Did that hurt?

00:12:48.540 --> 00:12:50.140
What's the matter, Kau?

00:12:51.880 --> 00:12:55.490
You're a masterpiece.

00:12:56.980 --> 00:12:59.430
This part is especially gorgeous.

00:13:03.500 --> 00:13:05.850
My, my. You're making such a display...

00:13:06.920 --> 00:13:08.520
What a naughty child you are.

00:13:24.000 --> 00:13:24.890
Later!

00:13:41.630 --> 00:13:43.900
I wonder what tag I should wear...

00:13:44.670 --> 00:13:46.130
Which do you think will work best?

00:13:46.560 --> 00:13:50.370
Just have one for display and
leave the rest hidden somewhere.

00:13:51.390 --> 00:13:52.510
I see!

00:13:52.510 --> 00:13:54.360
That way, I won't be targeted, huh?

00:13:59.980 --> 00:14:00.930
Keisuke?!

00:14:01.320 --> 00:14:02.400
Don't move!

00:14:02.400 --> 00:14:04.460
Move and your friend gets it.

00:14:05.010 --> 00:14:06.180
Got it?

00:14:09.400 --> 00:14:10.770
Let go of Keisuke!

00:14:10.980 --> 00:14:12.340
What, you gonna kill me?

00:14:12.340 --> 00:14:14.770
This guy is gonna die first!

00:14:18.050 --> 00:14:18.850
Keisuke!

00:14:19.470 --> 00:14:20.900
I'm taking these!

00:14:21.340 --> 00:14:24.010
Guys like you are the biggest suckers!

00:14:24.710 --> 00:14:28.410
I-If you do that, the Executioners will probably go after you!

00:14:29.630 --> 00:14:30.960
Like that shit actually matters.

00:14:30.960 --> 00:14:34.290
They'll kill whoever they see, rule breaker or not.

00:14:34.760 --> 00:14:38.570
So there's no need to follow the rules, yeah?!

00:14:40.130 --> 00:14:40.710
You damned--

00:14:41.840 --> 00:14:42.550
What?!

00:14:47.760 --> 00:14:49.060
Y-You are--?!

00:15:03.760 --> 00:15:05.360
I'm taking these back.

00:15:08.000 --> 00:15:09.560
T-This guy...!

00:15:09.560 --> 00:15:10.660
You're still gonna fight?

00:15:22.960 --> 00:15:24.130
Are you alright?

00:15:24.410 --> 00:15:28.730
I'm sorry. I promised that I'd take
care of myself, but this happened...

00:15:28.730 --> 00:15:30.680
And I'm so mindless...

00:15:31.140 --> 00:15:31.860
Here.

00:15:36.430 --> 00:15:37.750
Wait up!

00:15:57.060 --> 00:15:58.130
Welcome back!

00:15:58.480 --> 00:15:59.310
Rin!

00:16:01.970 --> 00:16:04.210
To say the least, this place sure is filthy.

00:16:04.510 --> 00:16:05.750
What do you want?

00:16:05.750 --> 00:16:09.270
I've come to tell you that this kind of place isn't a great hide-out.

00:16:10.530 --> 00:16:11.720
It's risky.

00:16:13.410 --> 00:16:17.390
Not only is it facing the main street, but people can also see you leave and enter.

00:16:17.390 --> 00:16:19.180
Eh? Is that so?

00:16:19.180 --> 00:16:21.490
It's quite visible from the outside.

00:16:22.030 --> 00:16:24.230
Not something I can recommend to newbies.

00:16:26.760 --> 00:16:28.230
So you really did register!

00:16:28.860 --> 00:16:30.140
Come on, show me your tags!

00:16:30.930 --> 00:16:32.830
All right, sure.

00:16:35.120 --> 00:16:36.620
Well, you've got some that you can use, huh?

00:16:36.960 --> 00:16:38.930
Really? That's great to know.

00:16:39.240 --> 00:16:42.830
That's right! Let's take a picture of us all finally joining Igra together!

00:16:48.510 --> 00:16:49.550
This guy is?

00:16:56.660 --> 00:16:59.600
You can look at it if you want, but it's not interesting.

00:17:05.780 --> 00:17:09.060
There are much more secure places
around! Let's go! Come follow me!

00:17:18.760 --> 00:17:19.860
Damn it, where is it?

00:17:20.190 --> 00:17:21.200
I don't have it...

00:17:29.010 --> 00:17:30.340
He must have it...

00:17:30.620 --> 00:17:32.580
Fuck!

00:17:41.350 --> 00:17:43.690
Bah, this sucks.

00:17:45.320 --> 00:17:47.440
Yo! We meet again!

00:17:47.840 --> 00:17:51.030
We're lookin' for some tag-thief now.

00:17:51.400 --> 00:17:53.080
Is it one of you guys?

00:17:54.220 --> 00:17:55.970
I-It's not...

00:17:55.970 --> 00:17:59.150
He's got blue hair. It wouldn't be any of these guys.

00:17:59.150 --> 00:18:00.620
Oh, really?

00:18:01.100 --> 00:18:04.820
Blue hair, blue hair. BLUE hair!

00:18:04.280 --> 00:18:05.680
Blue hair? Isn't it...

00:18:05.820 --> 00:18:06.520
Yeah.

00:18:10.210 --> 00:18:12.340
I've got something to speak to you about. Come with me for a bit!

00:18:12.340 --> 00:18:13.250
Hey!

00:18:13.250 --> 00:18:15.550
Shut up! You want the Executioners to find us?!

00:18:15.850 --> 00:18:16.670
Akira?!

00:18:17.020 --> 00:18:18.800
What just happened?

00:18:24.390 --> 00:18:26.560
They won't find us all the way out here.

00:18:26.560 --> 00:18:28.270
What the hell do you want with me?

00:18:29.400 --> 00:18:30.860
Give it back.

00:18:31.130 --> 00:18:32.350
Give what back?

00:18:32.350 --> 00:18:34.320
Don't play dumb! You picked it up, didn't you?!

00:18:37.360 --> 00:18:38.490
You mean this?

00:18:40.310 --> 00:18:41.910
Is it something important to you?

00:18:42.790 --> 00:18:44.040
It's my younger sister's...

00:18:44.410 --> 00:18:45.840
You have a younger sister?

00:18:47.840 --> 00:18:49.550
I know about you.

00:18:51.350 --> 00:18:52.670
You're Lost, right?

00:18:53.620 --> 00:18:58.600
I knew from the moment I saw you that
you're the undefeated champion of Bl@ster.

00:18:59.390 --> 00:19:03.020
Victory after victory, but you never seemed to be pleased.

00:19:03.410 --> 00:19:05.900
It always seemed like you were expressionless and apathetic.

00:19:05.900 --> 00:19:07.860
That's why you were called Lost.

00:19:10.050 --> 00:19:14.490
There was no one in Bl@ster who didn't know who Lost was.

00:19:14.940 --> 00:19:16.360
You were in Bl@ster too?

00:19:16.700 --> 00:19:20.070
Yeah, kinda. You ever hear of the name 'Takeru' anywhere?

00:19:20.390 --> 00:19:20.910
No...

00:19:21.940 --> 00:19:24.250
Of course you didn't. I quit soon after.

00:19:25.360 --> 00:19:26.540
Why are you in Toshima, then?

00:19:26.760 --> 00:19:29.590
I'm here for the money, duh.

00:19:30.050 --> 00:19:32.070
I wasn't able to earn much of an income back there.

00:19:32.070 --> 00:19:35.990
But I heard that if I were to win
here, I could get a shitload of cash.

00:19:36.490 --> 00:19:39.420
That's not all, though. If I were to defeat the Il Re,

00:19:39.420 --> 00:19:40.820
I'd become the new drug lord.

00:19:40.820 --> 00:19:43.550
That's the highest position in the world right now.

00:19:46.580 --> 00:19:49.320
Why'd you join Igra, Lost?

00:19:49.720 --> 00:19:53.070
Didn't you get enough money from your Bl@ster wins?

00:19:54.450 --> 00:19:56.550
I didn't join for the money.

00:19:56.550 --> 00:19:57.990
Then why?

00:20:00.940 --> 00:20:02.340
Not gonna say?

00:20:02.340 --> 00:20:05.600
Must be nice to be the almighty carefree Lost!

00:20:05.600 --> 00:20:09.040
First off, do you know how much trouble and danger there'll be

00:20:09.040 --> 00:20:11.170
if you wanna fight your way
through the ranks and beat Il Re?

00:20:12.110 --> 00:20:12.920
I do.

00:20:13.810 --> 00:20:15.460
Are you just going to say you 'get it?!'

00:20:17.330 --> 00:20:19.840
Must be nice to be someone
that's not impoverished, huh?

00:20:20.340 --> 00:20:23.720
You done? I'll be leaving now.

00:20:25.300 --> 00:20:28.940
Everyone on top is always like this!

00:20:29.890 --> 00:20:32.640
It pisses me off! You can have everything you want,

00:20:32.640 --> 00:20:35.250
but still have this expression on your face like it's not enough!

00:20:35.250 --> 00:20:40.700
Why don't you think about those who
are speaking from the ground for once?!

00:20:41.350 --> 00:20:46.150
